---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Schema Registry in front of a Kafka topic, and the upgrade order the BACKWARD mode implies.
// Facts (BACKWARD is the default; consumers first, then producers; the registry checks a new schema
// version against earlier ones) are from Confluent's Schema Registry documentation. Plain inline SVG, site tokens.

const W = 900;
const H = 360;
const msgs = ['v1', 'v1', 'v1', 'v2', 'v2'];
const mx0 = 390;
---
<figure class="bf">
  <div class="bf-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Messages through a broker with a schema registry. A producer on schema v2 first has its schema checked by the registry against the earlier versions under the BACKWARD rule. If accepted, it writes v2 messages to a topic that already holds v1 messages. Consumers on the new schema read both v1 and v2. Under BACKWARD the upgrade order is consumers first, then producers.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="bf-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>The registry checks the schema before the first message is sent</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Registry kiểm tra schema trước khi message đầu tiên được gửi</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="300" y="50" width="300" height="64" rx="5" class="bf-box is-key" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={336} y={82} size={28} />
    <text x="470" y="76" text-anchor="middle" class="bf-title">Schema Registry</text>
    <text x="470" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="bf-small">
      <tspan data-lang-en>mode BACKWARD (the default)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>chế độ BACKWARD (mặc định)</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="170" width="170" height="80" rx="5" class="bf-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={48} y={210} size={28} />
    <text x="74" y="204" class="bf-title">Producer</text>
    <text x="74" y="226" class="bf-small">
      <tspan data-lang-en>new schema v2</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>schema mới v2</tspan>
    </text>

    <path d="M105,170 L105,82 L292,82" class="bf-dash" />
    <polygon points="291,77 291,87 300,82" class="bf-head" />
    <text x="116" y="132" class="bf-small">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1. is v2 compatible?</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1. v2 có tương thích không?</tspan>
    </text>

    <DiagramIcon name="kafka" x={mx0 + 8} y={156} size={22} />
    <text x={mx0 + 140} y="166" text-anchor="middle" class="bf-small">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Topic (old messages stay)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Topic (message cũ vẫn còn)</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x={mx0 - 10} y="176" width="290" height="68" rx="5" class="bf-box" />
    {msgs.map((m, i) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={mx0 + i * 54} y="190" width="44" height="40" rx="4" class={m === 'v2' ? 'bf-msg is-new' : 'bf-msg'} />
        <text x={mx0 + i * 54 + 22} y="215" text-anchor="middle" class="bf-title">{m}</text>
      </g>
    ))}

    <path d={`M190,210 L${mx0 - 16},210`} class="bf-arrow" />
    <polygon points={`${mx0 - 17},205 ${mx0 - 17},215 ${mx0 - 8},210`} class="bf-head" />
    <text x="200" y="198" class="bf-small">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2. writes v2</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2. ghi v2</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="715" y="170" width="170" height="80" rx="5" class="bf-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="worker" x={744} y={210} size={28} />
    <text x="768" y="204" class="bf-title">Consumer</text>
    <text x="768" y="226" class="bf-small">
      <tspan data-lang-en>reads v1 and v2</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>đọc cả v1 và v2</tspan>
    </text>
    <path d={`M${mx0 + 282},210 L706,210`} class="bf-arrow" />
    <polygon points="705,205 705,215 714,210" class="bf-head" />

    <rect x="20" y="288" width="860" height="52" rx="5" class="bf-result" />
    <text x="36" y="311" class="bf-title">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Upgrade order under BACKWARD: consumers first, then producers.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thứ tự nâng cấp với BACKWARD: consumer trước, producer sau.</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="330" class="bf-small">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Knight turned its flag on while one reader was still old. Following this order avoids exactly that.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Knight bật cờ khi vẫn còn một bên đọc là code cũ. Làm theo thứ tự này thì tránh đúng chuyện đó.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Confluent Schema Registry in front of a Kafka topic. Compatibility modes and the upgrade order are from Confluent's documentation.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Confluent Schema Registry đặt trước một Kafka topic. Các chế độ tương thích và thứ tự nâng cấp lấy từ tài liệu của Confluent.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bf { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bf-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bf text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .bf .bf-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .bf .bf-title { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .bf .bf-small { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bf-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bf-box.is-key { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bf-msg { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bf-msg.is-new { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bf-result { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bf-arrow, .bf-dash { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bf-dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .bf-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bf figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
